ent-STHunterPouch = hunting pouch
    .desc = A hunting pouch worn around the waist, made from a thick tanned hide. Capable of holding various devices and tools and used for the transport of trophies.
ent-STBeltHunterUtility = alien toolbelt
    .desc = A modular belt with various clips. This version lacks any hunting functionality, and is commonly used by engineers to transport important tools.
